Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.74,0:22:57.02,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,真昼 你很紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:57.02,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,緊張してる？真昼君
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.92,0:22:59.82,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,嗯 有点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:22:59.82,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,はい ちょっと
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.86,0:23:01.76,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:01.76,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,私も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.60,0:23:04.04,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,菊小姐也紧张？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:04.04,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,キクさんもですか？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.08,0:23:08.86,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,我还是 头一回在这么讲究的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:08.86,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,俺 こんなおしゃれなところで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.86,0:23:11.80,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,和女孩子待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:11.80,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,女の人と一緒に過ごすの初めてで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.82,0:23:16.08,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,就怕哪里做得不好 让菊小姐丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.82,0:23:16.08,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,キクさんに恥ずかしい思いさせないか 心配で
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.94,0:23:22.90,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,我也怕自己会让真昼不开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:22.90,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,私も 真昼君に嫌な思いをさせないか 心配
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.32,0:23:24.02,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:24.02,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.40,0:23:27.68,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,原来我们都一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.40,0:23:27.68,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,同じね 私たち
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.56,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,啊 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.56,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,あ はい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.88,0:23:31.88,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,会不会有那么一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:31.88,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,いつか
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.52,0:23:36.16,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,觉得不管对这个人做什么都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:36.16,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,この人になら何をしても大丈夫だって
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.80,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,真的能放心到这种地步呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.80,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,安心できる時が来るのかしらね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.18,0:23:41.88,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.18,0:23:41.88,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,そうですね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.30,0:23:44.20,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,总有一天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.30,0:23:44.20,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,いつか
